<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/icon.svg">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/icon.svg">

    <!-- google font: montserrat -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
    html {
        font-size: 13px;
    }

    button, input, select, option, textarea {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    }

    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        background-color: #e4e5e7;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 0px;
        color: #1f2933;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    ::selection {
        background-color: #0b3866;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    ::-moz-selection {
        background-color: #0b3866;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: hsl(0, 0%, 100%);
        padding: 15px;
        flex: 1 0 auto;
    }

    footer {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        width: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(60deg, #0b3866 0%, #28517a 100%);
        border-top: 4px solid rgb(236, 154, 0);
        color: #e5e7eb;
        padding: 25px max(30px, calc((100% - 1200px) / 2));
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    footer a {
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    footer a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    h1 {
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 5px 15px;
        background-color: #e9e9ed;
        color: black;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        transition: background-color 0.25s ease;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    .btn:hover {
        background-color: #dddde2;
    }

    nav {
        background-color: #0b3866;
        background: linear-gradient(60deg, #0b3866 0%, #28517a 100%);
        padding: 25px 20px;
        border-radius: 0;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        display: flex;
        gap: 20px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: start;
        border-bottom: 6px solid rgb(236, 154, 0);
    }

    nav a {
        color: #e5e7eb;
        background-color: #28517a;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        transition: background-color 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 13px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        color: #ffffff;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    {{> navbar}}
    <div class="container">
        {{{body}}}
    </div>
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Vertex. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
        <p>Todas las imágenes de los productos son sólo a modo ilustrativo y pueden diferir del artículo en stock. Los precios indicados tienen IVA incluído y pueden sufrir variaciones sin previo aviso. Disponibilidad sujeta a stock.</p>  
    </footer>
</body>
</html>